direction: right

Discord: {
  shape: cylinder

}

Riot Games API: {
  shape: cloud

}

Koga Bot (Node.js): {
  shape: package
  
  Discord Client: {
    shape: rectangle
  }
  
  Command Handler: {
    shape: rectangle
  }
  
  Polling Worker: {
    shape: rectangle
  }
  
  Riot API Service: {
    shape: rectangle
  }
  
  History Engine: {
    shape: rectangle
  }
  
  Database Service: {
    shape: rectangle
  }
  
  Discord Client -> Command Handler: Slash Commands
  Command Handler -> Database Service: Config/Vincular
  Command Handler -> History Engine: /comparativo
  
  Polling Worker -> Database Service: Get Tracked Players
  Polling Worker -> Riot API Service: Check New Matches
  Riot API Service -> History Engine: Match Data
  History Engine -> Discord Client: Send Notification
}

SQLite Database: {
  shape: cylinder

}

Discord -> Koga Bot.Discord Client: Webhooks/Events
Koga Bot.Discord Client -> Discord: Messages/Embeds

Koga Bot.Riot API Service -> Riot Games API: HTTP GET (ACCOUNT-V1, MATCH-V5)
Riot Games API -> Koga Bot.Riot API Service: JSON Data

Koga Bot.Database Service -> SQLite Database: Read/Write
SQLite Database -> Koga Bot.Database Service: Results
